calceph
------------------------------------------
This library is designed to access the binary planetary ephemeris files, such
INPOPxx, JPL DExxx and SPICE ephemeris files.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libcalceph-devel-5.0.1-1bl1
  libcalceph2-5.0.1-1bl1
  libgfortran5-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.7-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-fortran-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://calceph.imcce.fr/

Canonical download:
  https://gitlab.obspm.fr/imcce_calceph/calceph/-/archive/calceph_5_0_1/calceph-calceph_5_0_1.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack calceph-5.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./calceph-5.0.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/calceph-5.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/calceph-5.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcalceph2-5.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcalceph-devel-5.0.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(calceph)
  /usr/bin/calceph_inspector.exe
  /usr/bin/calceph_queryorientation.exe
  /usr/bin/calceph_queryposition.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/calceph.README
  /usr/share/doc/calceph/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/calceph/COPYING_CECILL_B.LIB
  /usr/share/doc/calceph/COPYING_CECILL_C.LIB
  /usr/share/doc/calceph/COPYING_CECILL_V2.1.LIB
  /usr/share/doc/calceph/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/calceph/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/calceph/README.rst
  /usr/share/doc/calceph/readme.txt
  /usr/share/man/man1/calceph_inspector.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/calceph_queryorientation.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/calceph_queryposition.1.gz

(libcalceph2)
  /usr/bin/cygcalceph-2.dll

(libcalceph-devel)
  /usr/include/calceph.h
  /usr/include/calceph.mod
  /usr/include/f90calceph.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/calceph/calcephConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/calceph/calcephConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/calceph/calcephTargets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/calceph/calcephTargets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libcalceph.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/calceph.pc

